Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Hook the libre UART protocol into the BMCU firmware

Adds the call sites needed for uart_protocol.cpp (this project's own file,
supplied separately) and guards the BambuBus/RS485 paths behind
DISABLE_BAMBUBUS so the libre build can own USART1.

Applies to: jarczakpawel/BMCU-C-PJARCZAK @ V10.5 (fbff4e3215bd...)
Files touched: 7   Changed lines: 59
